<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>AI chatbot development | Bakhtawar Khan</title><meta name="description" content="Knowledge-based answers, guided conversations and API-connected assistance, scoped around your content, users and review requirements."><link rel="canonical" href="https://mr-bakhtawar.netlify.app/ai-chatbot-development.html"><meta property="og:url" content="https://mr-bakhtawar.netlify.app/ai-chatbot-development.html"><meta property="og:type" content="website"><link rel="stylesheet" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700&amp;family=Manrope:wght@400;500;600;700&amp;display=swap"><script>(function(){try{document.documentElement.dataset.theme=localStorage.getItem('portfolio-theme')||(matchMedia('(prefers-color-scheme: dark)').matches?'dark':'light')}catch(e){}})()</script><link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/css/academy.css"><link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/css/portfolio.css"><script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"WebPage","url":"https://mr-bakhtawar.netlify.app/ai-chatbot-development.html","name":"AI chatbot development","description":"Knowledge-based answers, guided conversations and API-connected assistance, scoped around your content, users and review requirements.","isPartOf":{"@id":"https://mr-bakhtawar.netlify.app/#website"}}</script><link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/css/master.css"><meta property="og:site_name" content="Mr. Bakhtawar Portfolio"><meta property="og:image" content="https://mr-bakhtawar.netlify.app/assets/images/bakhtawar-portfolio-social-v1.png"><meta name="twitter:image" content="https://mr-bakhtawar.netlify.app/assets/images/bakhtawar-portfolio-social-v1.png"><meta property="og:image:alt" content="Mr. Bakhtawar Portfolio — Bakhtawar Khan. Personal Digital Portfolio · MBK Global."><meta name="twitter:image:alt" content="Mr. Bakhtawar Portfolio — Bakhtawar Khan. Personal Digital Portfolio · MBK Global."><meta property="og:image:width" content="1200"><meta property="og:image:height" content="630"><meta property="og:image:type" content="image/png"><meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image"><meta property="og:title" content="AI chatbot development | Bakhtawar Khan"><meta name="twitter:title" content="AI chatbot development | Bakhtawar Khan"><meta property="og:description" content="Knowledge-based answers, guided conversations and API-connected assistance, scoped around your content, users and review requirements."><meta name="twitter:description" content="Knowledge-based answers, guided conversations and API-connected assistance, scoped around your content, users and review requirements."><link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/css/identity.css"><link rel="icon" href="/favicon.svg" type="image/svg+xml"><link rel="apple-touch-icon" href="/assets/images/portfolio-icon-180.png"><link rel="manifest" href="/site.webmanifest"></head><body class="academy page-service master-refresh"><header class="academy-header" id="top"><a class="academy-brand personal-brand" href="/"><span>Bakhtawar Khan<small>Personal Digital Portfolio · MBK Global</small></span></a><button class="academy-menu" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="academy-nav">Menu <span>+</span></button><nav id="academy-nav" aria-label="Main navigation"><a href="/">Home</a><a href='/about'>About</a><a href='/projects'>Projects</a><a href='/services'>Services</a><a class='header-cta' href='/hire-me'>Let’s talk <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><details class="portfolio-more"><summary>More</summary><div class="portfolio-panel"><section><h2>Professional work</h2><a href='/case-studies'>Case Studies</a><a href='/changelog'>Projects Changelog</a><a href='/delivered-project'>Process</a><a href='/resources'>Resources</a><a href='/news'>Notes</a></section><section><h2>Contact &amp; career</h2><a href='/book-a-call'>Book a Call</a><a href='/resume'>Resume / CV</a><a href='/hire-me'>Hire Me</a></section><section><h2>Content &amp; media</h2><a href='/gallery'>Gallery</a><a href='/blog'>Blog &amp; Articles</a><a href='/faq'>FAQs</a></section><section><h2>Personal brand</h2><a href='/about-muhammad-bakhtawar-khan'>Founder Profile</a><a href='/social'>Social Profiles</a><a href='/official-links'>Official Links</a></section></div></details><button class="theme-toggle" type="button" aria-label="Switch color theme">◐</button></nav></header><a class="skip-link" href="#main-content">Skip to content</a><main id="main-content" class="academy-main"><section class="academy-page-hero expanded-hero "><div><div class="academy-breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a><span>/</span>Service scope</div><p class="academy-kicker">Service scope / BAKHTAWAR KHAN</p><h1>A useful assistant needs more than a prompt.</h1><p class="expanded-deck">Knowledge-based answers, guided conversations and API-connected assistance, scoped around your content, users and review requirements.</p><div class="editorial-actions"><a class='academy-text-link' href='/projects'>Explore the work ↗</a><a class='academy-text-link' href='/hire-me'>Start a conversation ↗</a></div></div></section><section class="editorial-section"><div class="editorial-label">01 / THE USE CASE</div><div><h2>Start with the task, not the platform.</h2><p>An assistant can help visitors find information in approved documentation, explain a product or collect an initial enquiry. It should say when it cannot answer and provide a human route rather than invent a policy.</p></div></section><section class="editorial-section"><div class="editorial-label">02 / POSSIBLE DELIVERABLES</div><div><h2>Know what is being built.</h2><p>A conversation map, approved knowledge sources, an interface prototype, scoped API integration, fallback states and a test/handover checklist. Model usage fees, hosting and ongoing content maintenance are agreed separately.</p></div></section><section class="editorial-section"><div class="editorial-label">03 / PROJECT REQUIREMENTS</div><div><h2>Before implementation begins.</h2><p>Provide the intended audience, supported questions, approved content, escalation contact and data-retention requirements. Provider access and a realistic evaluation set are needed before promising a production integration.</p></div></section><section class="editorial-section"><div class="editorial-label">04 / SAFETY &amp; HANDOVER</div><div><h2>Design for the conversation that goes wrong.</h2><p>Agree on what the bot must not do, what data it can access and when a person takes over. Test ambiguous questions, provider failures, duplicate requests, rate limits and deletion requests. AI outputs need evaluation against approved answers; a polished demonstration is not proof of reliable production behavior.</p><a class='academy-text-link' href='/resources'>Official documentation and learning resources ↗</a></div></section><section class="editorial-section"><div class="editorial-label">NEXT / DISCUSS THE FIT</div><div><h2>Tell me what the conversation should achieve.</h2><p>Share the audience, channel, expected volume, existing tools and preferred timeline. I’ll help clarify the scope and dependencies; availability and implementation feasibility are confirmed before commitment.</p><a class='academy-text-link' href='/hire-me'>Plan a project ↗</a></div></section><div data-portrait-track data-caption="A personal archive / Bakhtawar Khan"></div></main><footer class="academy-footer"><div><a class="academy-brand personal-brand" href="/"><span>Bakhtawar Khan<small>Personal Digital Portfolio · MBK Global</small></span></a><p>Thoughtful technology. Useful knowledge. Work in progress.</p></div><nav aria-label="Footer"><a href='/resources'>Resources</a><a href='/official-links'>Official links</a><a href='/gallery'>Gallery</a><a href='/resume'>Resume</a><a href='/faq'>FAQ</a><a href='/privacy-policy'>Privacy</a></nav><div class="academy-colophon"><span>© 2026 Bakhtawar Khan · MBK Global</span><a href="#top">Back to top ↑</a></div></footer><script defer src="/assets/js/academy.js"></script><script defer src="/assets/js/portfolio.js"></script><script defer src="/assets/js/visual-track.js"></script></body></html>